{"cantica":"purgatorio","cantoNumber":10,"title":"Canto X","totalDuration":341.12,"segments":[{"id":1,"speaker":"narrator","text":"When we crossed the threshold of that gate\nwhich souls misuse through their corrupted love—\nmaking the crooked path appear straight—\nI heard it echo shut behind us.\nHad I looked back upon it then,\nwhat excuse could justify my failure?\nWe climbed upward through a fractured rock\nthat rolled and shifted side to side\nlike waves advancing and retreating.","startTime":0,"endTime":22.88,"words":[{"word":"When","start":0.081,"end":0.321},{"word":"we","start":0.321,"end":0.561},{"word":"crossed","start":0.561,"end":0.881},{"word":"the","start":0.881,"end":1.241},{"word":"threshold","start":1.241,"end":1.561},{"word":"of","start":1.561,"end":1.681},{"word":"that","start":1.681,"end":1.921},{"word":"gate","start":1.921,"end":2.241},{"word":"which","start":2.241,"end":2.561},{"word":"souls","start":2.561,"end":3.121},{"word":"misuse","start":3.121,"end":3.681},{"word":"through","start":3.681,"end":3.921},{"word":"their","start":3.921,"end":4.081},{"word":"corrupted","start":4.081,"end":4.641},{"word":"love—","start":4.641,"end":5.601},{"word":"making","start":5.601,"end":5.921},{"word":"the","start":5.921,"end":6.041},{"word":"crooked","start":6.041,"end":6.401},{"word":"path","start":6.401,"end":6.921},{"word":"appear","start":6.921,"end":7.321},{"word":"straight—","start":7.321,"end":8.321},{"word":"I","start":8.321,"end":8.428},{"word":"heard","start":8.428,"end":8.601},{"word":"it","start":8.601,"end":8.881},{"word":"echo","start":8.881,"end":9.281},{"word":"shut","start":9.281,"end":9.601},{"word":"behind","start":9.601,"end":10.001},{"word":"us.","start":10.001,"end":10.881},{"word":"Had","start":10.881,"end":11.041},{"word":"I","start":11.041,"end":11.161},{"word":"looked","start":11.161,"end":11.441},{"word":"back","start":11.441,"end":11.721},{"word":"upon","start":11.721,"end":11.921},{"word":"it","start":11.921,"end":12.081},{"wor